        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Samuel Flores Borrego; Jorge Eduardo Costilla Sánchez\n- Organizations: Gulf Cartel\n- Events: Infighting in the Gulf Cartel; death of Samuel Flores Borrego\n- Concepts: Metros; Rojos\n\nFacts:\n- Jorge Eduardo Costilla Sánchez was born on 1 August 1971.\n- Jorge Eduardo Costilla Sánchez was a top leader of the Gulf Cartel and a former Mexican drug lord.\n- Samuel Flores Borrego became the right-hand man of Jorge Eduardo Costilla Sánchez after Flores Borrego's arrest.\n- Samuel Flores Borrego died in September 2011.\n- The infighting in the Gulf Cartel began directly after the death of Samuel Flores Borrego in September 2011.\n- The infighting in the Gulf Cartel was a series of confrontations between the Metros and the Rojos, two factions within the Gulf Cartel engaged in a power struggle.",
